{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "5acd6af01eb392f9990ed8c156c517c555a7d5376a77314eedcfb396554b245f", "ja": "注目っ！　茜ちゃん達の未来", "zh": "瞩目！小茜们的未来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0558c441a306226682ea4630b09f26976e72f23db186548a9473b5ff7ebd44c7", "ja": "帰りの船上、駄々をこねた事をプロデューサ\nーに謝る茜。反省して見えたのは一瞬で、す\nぐにいつもの調子に。映画の完成が楽しみと\n語るアイドル達に、これからもみんなと一緒\nに進むと誓うプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "在返程的船上，茜向制作人\n为自己耍小脾气的事道了歉。但看起来在反省\n也只是一瞬间的事，她很快就恢复了往常的步调。\n面对表示期待电影制作完成的偶像们，\n制作人暗自起誓，今后也要和大家一同前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "336f9f13d8c799429a883e47ebbc11147a590071f1b55b241a67573628800255", "ja": "（出発直前になり、ようやく全員が揃った。\nなんとか間に合ったな！）", "zh": "（临出发前，总算所有人都到齐了。好歹是赶上了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "10eea12374b21e864feb6c1dbc7821d3944ffafa98914c730084a632c61409f3", "ja": "はぁ～……。まさか最終日に\nこんなことが起こるなんて思わなかったわ。", "zh": "哈啊～……。没想到居然会在最后一天发生这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "4b5a894fcd5ed0bec6bfab03d670184adeb8d48cf3498f05117aa06bf49ea75f", "ja": "全員そろって出発できそうだし、もういいじゃない。\nそれより、早く帰りましょ♪", "zh": "看起来大家都能到齐出发了，这样不就挺好的吗？\n比起这个，还是快点回去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "738c8aa46a461b4359bb08223af459383aa34b12310e9f68d4f992813efed04b", "ja": "そうそう！\nいろんなことがあったけど、全部いい思い出だね！", "zh": "对对！\n虽然发生了各种各样的事，但全都成了美好的回忆呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "470934a1dccf630bdd214a8ce492bc4a67e6af015c058c6a43116f62370e1115", "ja": "ほとんど全部、茜が原因でしょうが！", "zh": "几乎全都是茜惹的祸吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "2460c80a115408e32f1c7be1a38edca955e3f161ec9458902af523008af2182c", "ja": "わ～っ！　茜ちゃん海よりも深く反省してるから！\nだから怒らないで、律子さん！", "zh": "哇～！我已经比小茜海还要深刻地反省了！\n所以别生气，律子姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "ff5efeeffe5524dfac0831e7c915c32cb8791a81ac348ed669149b5bacd74475", "ja": "うう、{$P$}ちゃん……。", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "26f7db44895b79b99404a46b6587ccd29648e6aa32baeffc5025ad00ff00febd", "ja": "ああ茜、お疲れ様。その様子だと、\n律子にこってり絞られたみたいだな？", "zh": "啊，茜，辛苦了。看你这样子，似乎被律子狠狠训了一顿啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "59cabe42133a1b817e9c181770b6d4fb93f6bc674cc2797d4e885b8a9904a86f", "ja": "うん、それもなんだけど……茜ちゃん、\n{$P$}ちゃんにも謝らないとって。", "zh": "嗯，这是一方面……还得向小茜和{$P$}道歉才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "afb77b2a9a12158e7a5d921adfe0f6003b0ed7546de0d6e24e6aa9af4a1d8eab", "ja": "謝る？", "zh": "要道歉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "ffa721aeb287f1d33d52a64bcd82b1b1a0d27ada0d6af5be2a9dedeb9099014a", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんはアイドルじゃないから\n茜ちゃんの気持ちはわからない……って。", "zh": "“{$P$}又不是偶像，\n根本不会懂小茜的心情”……这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d33347f8f1fdd073fe23c7cd061f849a74e75840de76afe688abed5c70b0d939", "ja": "確かに堪えたけど、俺がアイドルじゃないのは本当だ。\nみんなの不安を、わかってやれない事もある。", "zh": "确实很难受，但我不是偶像，这是事实。\n有时候，我也无法真正理解大家内心的不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d8a8abad8fb6754331c0427328e42f66093f5d3558ab2156876acfdb860bf64c", "ja": "でも、だからこそ、みんなの声をちゃんと聞いて、\nしっかり寄り添いたいと思ってるよ。", "zh": "但是，正因如此，我才想认真倾听大家的声音，好好陪伴在大家身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "febd295380e99546989dfc7080a107e28e9f4bfe633ee6fac63fd2caff11cf6f", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……\nうん！　その意気だよ！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n嗯！就是这个劲头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "886b5f1e2b04699ea3c28609b8d4f3118ee930726397c91e64b5733cbe83c342", "ja": "茜ちゃん、今回の撮影で、\nみんなの愛をたくさん感じちゃった気がするなー。", "zh": "小茜，这次拍摄，我好像感受到了大家满满的爱呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7ddd321113559804107c81c13683f5428d7f9de34991b795c55216f2872946ee", "ja": "ああ。\nそれは、茜がみんなと築いてきたものだな。", "zh": "啊。\n那是茜和大家一起建立起来的羁绊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "926eb1338f97002e2d9e4542fdcdb9a04c049c60c9d790347a6f22624be0e8eb", "ja": "そうかも！　ねえ、{$P$}ちゃん。\nこの映画が公開されたら……。", "zh": "也许吧！对了，{$P$}。\n等这部电影上映后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "7f03e162ea14e42351e6aac13aab7be1b8668248ebed3bc3007656a31390afa8", "ja": "茜ちゃんのカワイさが、世界中に発見されちゃうよね？\nハリウッドからスカウトが来ちゃうかも？", "zh": "小茜的可爱要被全世界发现了吧？说不定好莱坞还会来挖人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "44fa48fa18c43ce8e43ca41b20f376a79a1d1793064e90e0e009cdefe0942c31", "ja": "元気と一緒に、調子に乗るのまで戻ってきたのか……\nまぁいいけど。うん、その方が茜らしいよ。", "zh": "看来不只是精神，连得意忘形也恢复了啊……\n\n不过也没什么。嗯，这样才像茜嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "a350f417ea97fd3d94f9f1ecb807012d93c4fb421b9e6bbef4eb8f16677721f9", "ja": "茜ちゃん、映画の公開がすっごく楽しみだよ！\n{$P$}ちゃんも、そうでしょ？", "zh": "小茜，我特别期待电影上映！\n{$P$}也这么想吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "57378dda9c0c9dd0e4bf13675d62482a051dd876bd4358c2ca798e7434756130", "ja": "ワタシも、早くファンのみんなに観せたいナ～。\nどんな風になるんだろうネ？", "zh": "我也想早点给所有粉丝看看呢～。\n不知道最后会拍成什么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "e73a457b1d76b08af209d7c5b599565b711906db27bd385aa22bad6af75363ae", "ja": "そうですね。それに、お芝居は\n観てもらえなければ、意味がありませんから。", "zh": "是啊。而且，如果没人来看，演戏也就没有意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "d086010e8580d29da0b2a2abc4a4f16a9f0f730bcfd6c092f7325c2a8212d273", "ja": "サスペンスホラー……本当に、新境地でした。\n家族も喜んでくれるかしら。", "zh": "悬疑恐怖片……真的是一次全新的尝试呢。\n家里人也会替我高兴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "c915a4ab5eed3009fbb7ccd109e26e7431418bcc37e24239319125e38381e9d8", "ja": "わたくしは商店が……ゴホン！　社交界の\n友人達に、少々怖がられてしまうかもしれませんわね。", "zh": "我恐怕会让商店的……咳咳！社交界的朋友们有点害怕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "f45503ec7e0d757584c86748bc2d6ae9b5819f3408ed691366373468254d492a", "ja": "あら、いいじゃないの千鶴！\n私達の演技で、たっぷり怖がらせちゃいましょ♪", "zh": "哎呀，这不是挺好的吗，千鹤！\n就用我们的演技，好好吓吓他们吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "51c89ae02837d1f68e8edde8c8a4ea597b804e2d7e5a7e7ff34b25079c2dbfa2", "ja": "この作品が、劇場の新たな一歩ってことですね。\nこれからが楽しみですね、{$P$}！", "zh": "这部作品就是剧场迈出的新一步，对吧。\n接下来真让人期待呢，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "9b2848c2119e10b5edb5dc8f06edfa14b80ec213b984facf8cc0b978428bab29", "ja": "律子さんの言うとおり！　撮影が終わっても、\n茜ちゃん達のアイドル活動は終わらない！", "zh": "律子说得对！就算拍摄结束了，\n小茜们的偶像活动也不会结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "b52ae563c7be1a4ebb10bf916f350bbc250663b8d2122a32546d84709928db1b", "ja": "次のステップにいざゆかん！　……もちろん、\n{$P$}ちゃんと一緒にね！", "zh": "向下一个阶段出发！……当然，要和{$P$}一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0131_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "98057a96b7bf1070f32edec7af06896859bbd97f26c822790f77fa3d53cbf130", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nこれからも、みんなと一緒に進むぞ！", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n今后也要和大家一起前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
